{
 "dur": 74.2,
 "vo": [
  {
   "id": "v01",
   "t": 0.4,
   "chunks": [
    "Why does fifty pounds",
    "on the cable machine",
    "feel so much lighter?",
    "Let's take one apart."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v02",
   "t": 5.91,
   "chunks": [
    "Steel plates ride up and down",
    "two guide rods.",
    "The selector pin decides",
    "how many plates you lift."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v03",
   "t": 12.44,
   "chunks": [
    "A steel cable runs from the stack,",
    "over a chain of pulleys,",
    "out to your handle."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v04",
   "t": 17.33,
   "chunks": [
    "Tie the cable straight to the stack,",
    "and it's one to one.",
    "Fifty on the pin,",
    "fifty in your hand."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v05",
   "t": 23.3,
   "chunks": [
    "But many machines hang the stack",
    "from a movable pulley.",
    "Now two strands of cable",
    "share the weight."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v06",
   "t": 29.16,
   "chunks": [
    "Each strand carries half,",
    "so your hand feels about 25 pounds.",
    "The price? Pull the handle two feet,",
    "and the stack rises one."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v07",
   "t": 37.89,
   "chunks": [
    "Force \u00d7 distance stays the same.",
    "Some machines go four to one:",
    "a quarter of the force,",
    "four times the travel."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v08",
   "t": 45.65,
   "chunks": [
    "Then, reality.",
    "Each pulley loses a few percent to friction.",
    "Lifting, it adds to the load.",
    "Lowering, it helps you."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v09",
   "t": 52.95,
   "chunks": [
    "The steel cable barely stretches,",
    "about a millimeter here,",
    "so the load hits instantly,",
    "not springy."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "t": 60.41,
   "chunks": [
    "So the label says fifty.",
    "Your hands feel about 25:",
    "closer to 30 pulling,",
    "20 letting go."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v11",
   "t": 67.6,
   "chunks": [
    "What should we take apart next?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v12",
   "t": 69.65,
   "chunks": [
    "Congrats! You've discovered",
    "the cable machine."
   ]
  }
 ]
}